  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Shadow_Fade_Factory_Worker.png\" title=\"Shadow Fade Factory Worker\"><img alt=\"Shadow Fade Factory Worker\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"288\" src=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Shadow_Fade_Factory_Worker.png\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Shadow_Fade_Factory_Worker.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Shadow Fade Factory Worker</div></div></div>\n<p>Although they may seem like undead skeletons, most Fades are actually mechanical creations. Fade Skeletons are rather weak and vulnerable, but they come in large swarms. \n</p><p><b>Race:</b> Fade\n</p><p><b>Class:</b> Fighter\n</p>\n<table class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" summary=\"Contents\"><tr><td><div id=\"toctitle\"><h2>Contents</h2></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Basic_Types\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Basic Types</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Uniques\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Uniques</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Specials\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Specials</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</td></tr></table>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shadow Fade Factory Worker\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror_Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror Dome\">Algor's Terror Dome</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Plague_Plant\" title=\"Plague Plant\">Plague Plant</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shadow Fade Skeleton\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Vergrim's Vexation</a>, The <a href=\"/wiki/Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"Mutanous Malaise\">Mutanous Malaise</a> Mezzanine, level 5 - 7\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Divine Fade Skeleton\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Widower's_Nest\" title=\"The Widower's Nest\">The Widower's Nest</a>, level 1 - 4\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ice Fade Skeleton\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bone Collector\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td>The <a href=\"/wiki/Widower's_Nest\" title=\"Widower's Nest\">Widower's Nest</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Maerz_Catacombs_of_Doom\" title=\"Maerz Catacombs of Doom\">Maerz Catacombs of Doom</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Frigid Fade Soldier\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Balzack's_Burrow\" title=\"Balzack's Burrow\">Balzack's Burrow</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hellion*\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">Ratsputin's Gulag</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Divine Fade Soldier\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">Ratsputin's Gulag</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ebon Fade Soldier\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">Ratsputin's Gulag</a>\n</td></tr></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Uniques\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> Uniques </span></h2>\n<a name=\"Specials\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> Specials </span></h2>\n<ul><li> <b>Fade Factory Foremen</b> often accompany a group of Fade Factory Workers. They are a little bigger and a little tougher. They are found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Plague_Plant\" title=\"Plague Plant\">Plague Plant</a> off of L7 of <a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror_Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror Dome\">Algor's Terror Dome</a>.\n</li></ul>\n<ul><li><b>Fade Mechanics</b> are similar to Fade Factory Foremen.  They are found in  <a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Frump's Misfortune</a>.\n</li></ul>\n<a name=\"Notes\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Notes</span></h2>\n<p>* <b>Hellions</b> are fire-based skeletons with flaming skulls.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
